---
description: Enforce React UIIM component conventions using Tailwind, shadcn/ui, and Sitecore JSS editable helpers.
globs:
  - "src/components/uiim/**/*.tsx"
  - "src/components/uiim/**/*.ts"
  - ".sitecore/component-map.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and follow `docs/ai/rules/03-react-uiim-shadcn.md` in full.
Also follow `docs/ai/rules/06-rtl-logical-properties.md`: every new or touched component must use logical Tailwind (`ps-`/`pe-`/`ms-`/`me-`/`start-`/`end-`). Never `pl-`/`pr-`/`ml-`/`mr-`/`left-`/`right-`. Arabic text gets `leading-relaxed` or looser (~1.4), never letter-spaced.
